WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:29.100
We're Ghouls's assassins.  I'm Mask of Light.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:31.570
I'm Mask of Darkness.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:36.520
We formed this tag team specifically to hunt for God Cards.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:42.250
We can't defeat those Ghouls unless we work together!

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.130
Work together...

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:46.670
My turn!

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.620
I flip over my set card!

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.240
Monster Reborn!

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:55.930
Blue-Eyes White Dragon revives!

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:00.930
Here I go!  The masked top spins!

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:04.600
Two of the three are spell cards.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:09.940
But the one I want is the strongest monster card in our decks!

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:15.880
The chosen card is...

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.620
Hooray!  Today is my lucky day!

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.080
Masked Beast Des Gardius!

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.020
3300 attack points?

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.450
It's stronger than Blue-Eyes!

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.350
I have one strategy left in my hand.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:40.450
But I can't do it if he attacks me.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:45.380
Which one should Des Gardius attack...

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:51.380
Obelisk the Tormentor

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:21.150
If he attacks me, it's all over.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:26.730
Yugi's Alpha The Magnet Warrior is in attack position.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:33.090
If I destroy it, you take 1900 points of damage.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:38.400
Yugi, you will die this turn.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:45.530
But in a tag duel, we don't win until we defeat both of them.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:52.810
It'll be nice to get rid of Yugi, but it's a bad idea to let Kaiba keep his Blue-Eyes.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.080
No, I will defeat Yugi!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.170
Coward.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:03.620
You think you're tough because you have a monster with 3300 attack points?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:04.860
What?

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.160
Thanks for defeating Yugi for me.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:13.800
My Blue-Eyes will destroy your monster next turn.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.670
Kaiba, are you baiting him with Blue-Eyes?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.770
It's true that Yugi's monster is weak.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.330
I can destroy it any time.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.110
So this turn, I should...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.850
I'll destroy Blue-Eyes!

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:37.890
Dark Destruction!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.500
Blue-Eyes is annihilated!

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.620
Forgive me, Blue-Eyes...

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.240
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.260
Yeah.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.780
Kaiba, Blue-Eyes's spirit...

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.680
...will be carried on by this card!

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.590
Ghouls, you fell for our trap!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.260
What?

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:22.200
My Blue-Eyes was a decoy so that we could bring out a stronger monster.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:23.670
No way!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:27.140
But you're not allowed to Tribute Summon!

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:30.960
It's true that we can't Tribute Summon.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:34.810
But watch what this card can do!

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.200
Gamma The Magnet Warrior!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:48.350
Here are Alpha, Beta and Gamma's special abilities!

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.200
Transform and combine!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:51.760
Transform and combine?

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.060
What?

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:10.980
That's...

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:14.760
Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:19.090
This is the power of our teamwork that will bring us victory.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:20.520
What?

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:24.710
Des Gardius has 3300 attack points.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:28.970
Valkyrion has 3500 attack points.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.450
Valkyrion has more attack points!

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.900
Yugi, attack!

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:38.570
Demolish the monster that destroyed my Blue-Eyes!

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:39.870
Kaiba...

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:43.750
The power of teamwork is nice.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:48.750
But it's not enough to suppress my Blue-Eyes's anger for being sacrificed.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:54.170
They don't have any set cards on their field.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:58.860
Valkyrion has enough attack points to destroy their monster.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:06.260
But I sense that they're not afraid of my attack.

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:11.630
Does Des Gardius have a secret ability?

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:16.130
Attack us, Yugi.  Just like Kaiba said.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.930
When you do, you're going straight to hell.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.330
Why are you hesitating, Yugi?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:28.430
My Blue-Eyes sacrificed itself so that you could play your trump card!

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:33.660
So destroy their monster with your trump card that's full of my anger!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.700
I set a card!

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:47.360
Kaiba, can you get rid of your desire for revenge this turn?

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.580
If you can, I'll attack.

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:50.690
What?

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:55.240
Emotions can affect a duelist's judgment.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.120
That's when the opponent can take advantage of you.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.730
Whatever!

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:02.630
Fighting is about anger!

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:04.500
Calm down, Kaiba.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.600
And look for a true victory.

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:10.700
A true victory?

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.170
My trump card is...

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.940
The God Card, Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:20.040
But I need three tributes to summon a God.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:26.480
As long as they have Mask of Restrict on their field, I can't summon Obelisk.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:34.120
Actually, there's one way to summon a God!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:43.770
Don't tell me that Yugi is using Valkyrion as a decoy?

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.650
A true victory...

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.340
...requires teamwork to win the duel.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:52.880
Yugi, attack.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.060
Okay!

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:57.520
Valkyrion attacks!

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:01.980
Magnet Saber!

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.190
You fell for it!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.520
It's destroyed.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.900
But this monster has an effect.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.830
An effect?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:22.480
Des Gardius leaves its masks when it goes to the graveyard.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:23.840
The masks form...

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:29.710
The Mask of Remnants!

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:38.160
Due to Des Gardius's desire for revenge, this mask turns your monster into our minion.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.960
Mask of Remnants equips on Valkyrion!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.320
Valkyrion is mine.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:58.400
Well done!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.520
It's over, Yugi.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.850
You have no monsters to protect you.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.720
Partner, you finish Yugi.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.720
I'll finish Kaiba.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:09.850
Okay.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:17.530
Kaiba made a fool out of me, so I must defeat him to get rid of my anger.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.170
My turn.

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:20.480
Nice!

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.900
Masquerade!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:33.580
I gain control of Mask of Light's monster this turn.

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.310
Get our revenge, Valkyrion!

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.170
Attack Yugi directly!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.610
Yugi!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:40.780
He's defeated!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:42.960
Are you sure?

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.960
I flip over my set card!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.600
De-Fusion!

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:53.860
What?

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:55.030
Impossible!

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:56.770
Remember this.

00:10:56.770 --> 00:11:00.620
You will lose due to your anger and desire for revenge!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.340
My turn!

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.770
I'll show you a God.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.800
God?  Whatever.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:10.980
I still have Mask of Restrict on my field.

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:15.250
You can't summon a God if you can't tribute!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:19.820
Your card says that I'm not allowed to tribute MY monsters.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:25.560
In that case, I'll use this card to tribute YOUR monsters.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.560
The spell card Soul Exchange!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:31.780
I tribute your Valkyrion!

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.100
Our monsters?

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:46.480
Yugi let us have his Valkyrion so that Kaiba could summon his God?

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:56.390
God will arrive!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:13.750
Witness the god of destruction that sleeps in my hand!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:17.470
Awaken, Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:31.020
Seto Kaiba!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:35.500
The God Card has chosen him as its master?

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.820
Vanish, you wimp!

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:01.490
God Hand Crusher!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.140
Partner!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.020
Are you okay, partner?

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:29.680
Obelisk the Tormentor's attack elminated your life points.

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:33.800
Your own trap will blow you up.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:40.060
The life counter on my explosive falls to 0!

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:45.500
Partner!

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:08.200
Hey!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.160
Partner, are you okay?

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.120
A parachute?

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.100
I figured you'd have something like that.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.260
This isn't a death match for you.

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:21.870
You can't defeat us anymore.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.520
Surrender.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.960
I'm not satisfied.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:35.420
Both opponents must be defeated in a tag match.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:38.090
I'll send him to hell.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:39.500
Wait, Kaiba.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.400
He's already lost his will to fight.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:47.030
We're duelists, so attacking him would damage our pride.

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:50.970
Crushing my enemies sustains my pride!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.270
What?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.070
Ma...ri...

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:03.140
Marik!

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:12.040
I saw Obelisk's power.  The power of a God.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.290
It was strong.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.220
Marik!  Stop hiding and come out!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.260
His personality changed.

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:24.560
Yeah.  Someone else is controlling him.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.600
No way!  By who?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.360
By the Ghouls's leader, Marik.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.040
He has the third God Card.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:34.710
The Winged Dragon of Ra's owner?

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.780
Nice to meet you, Kaiba.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:43.720
Marik is the second target I'm after in Battle City.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:49.560
Thanks for dueling my minions.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:52.130
That bought me a lot of time.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:55.160
My plan is proceeding smoothly.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:02.170
By looking through the Rare Hunters' eyes, I know how your decks are constructed.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.200
There's no way you can defeat my deck.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:12.320
My Winged Dragon of Ra is more powerful than your cards.

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:14.980
It's the strongest card in history.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.650
Ra has more power than Obelisk?

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:25.090
My other plan is to battle you, Yugi.  It's a battle 3000 years in the making.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:30.760
For the gravekeepers to get revenge, it must end in your death.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:37.400
I've created a cruel play that will lower the curtains on my revenge.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:41.210
Your friends are actors in my play, and they're waiting for you.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:44.820
They're waiting for the lead actor to take the stage.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.450
My friends?

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.570
You mean Jonouchi and the others?

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:52.190
Marik, what did you do to them?

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:55.870
The puppet show will be worth watching.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:57.790
Puppet show?

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:02.730
Did you turn them into your puppets, like you did with the Rare Hunters?

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:09.420
Yes.  Your friends are under my control.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.420
Yugi, come to your friends.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:16.080
Battle Jonouchi on the stage of death.

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.770
Marik, how dare you!

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.510
Where's my brother?

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.000
What happened to Mokuba?

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:29.190
I won the duel, so give back Mokuba as promised!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:31.920
Promise?  Give back?

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.620
You punk!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:38.620
Kaiba, Marik is controlling him like a puppet.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.200
It's pointless to grill him.

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.370
Marik!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:52.150
Kaiba, please find Jonouchi's location.

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:54.310
Mokuba will be there too.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:59.720
I will get Mokuba back, but there's something I must do first.

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:07.020
Yugi, take this.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:10.920
You won this Puzzle Card by defeating the Ghouls.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.600
We each get one.

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:15.920
We now have six each.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:19.740
So we've qualified for the Battle City Finals.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:24.370
Kaiba, I don't care about going to the finals.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:27.760
My friends are in danger, so I want to find them!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.080
Find your friends...

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.510
Big brother!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.400
Mokuba!

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:53.110
Mokuba, you're OK?

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.240
Yeah!  Anzu saved me!

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:57.100
So Anzu is safe?

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.910
What about Jonouchi and Honda?

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:01.910
Sorry, but I only know about Anzu.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:06.350
When I went back to the warehouse, no one was there.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:09.930
Get on the helicopter, Yugi.

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:16.600
Your friend saved Mokuba, and I don't like to be in debt.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.000
Kaiba...

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:28.470
I'd like some box lunches!

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:29.960
Okay, which one?

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.640
One of each.

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:33.260
What?

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:36.410
Please hurry!  The train's leaving.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:48.460
Did Honda miss the train?

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.570
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:52.900
I almost missed the train.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:55.360
Shizuka, what would you like?

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:58.880
Variety box, sandwiches, sushi, eel...  Anything you like!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.530
Umm...

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:07.380
What is it?

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:11.400
You're the only one I can ask.

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:16.320
Does my brother think that I'm a burden?

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.330
A burden?  No way.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.260
Why do you ask?

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:28.270
He paid for my operation and also gave me courage.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:32.210
But I can't do anything for him.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.140
What are you talking about?

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:40.170
He can do all this because he cares about his one and only sister.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:44.510
I said that I wanted to leave to cheer for my brother...

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:48.110
...but in truth, it's because I'm scared to remove my bandages by myself.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:51.090
I'm relying on my brother to give me courage again.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:56.080
In that case, you should give him courage this time.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:00.340
Give him the courage to win the finals.

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.740
You're right.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:06.640
This isn't the time to be scared about removing my bandages.

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:10.810
It's my turn to give him courage.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:12.740
That's right.

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.650
Mokuba, have you found him?

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:19.480
I found him!

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:23.590
The signal from Jonouchi's Duel Disk is coming from Domino Pier.

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:25.220
Domino Pier?

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:29.590
That's where we left to go to Duelist Kingdom.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.540
Please be safe...

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:48.570
To rescue Jonouchi and me from the Ghouls, Yugi heads to Domino Pier in Kaiba's helicopter.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:52.310
Kaiba asks him about Marik and the Ghouls.

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:58.820
Yugi talks about his relationship with Marik's family that goes back to ancient Egypt.

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:01.880
Yugi, what will happen to us?

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:04.940
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Bonds

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:06.310
Duel, standby!

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:26.600
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:31.970
I feel like I've been here

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:41.630
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:53.140
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:56.030 --> 00:23:00.640
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:05.940
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:11.020
Will never change

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:16.290
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:21.520
To be who I am

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:26.760
I've kept searching for something

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:31.440
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:34.400
I learned that's the answer

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:41.480
From now until forever...
